IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PAY0010.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY PAY0010C.
01 OUT-RECORD.
    05 OT-AMOUNT          PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM CALC-OVERTIME
    DISPLAY "OT-AMOUNT=" OT-AMOUNT
    STOP RUN.
CALC-OVERTIME.
    IF EMPLOYEE-TYPE = 'C'
        MOVE 0 TO OT-AMOUNT
    ELSE IF HRS-WKD GREATER THAN 60
        COMPUTE OT-AMOUNT = PERIOD-GROSS * 0.30
    ELSE IF HRS-WKD GREATER THAN 44
        COMPUTE OT-AMOUNT ROUNDED = PERIOD-GROSS * 0.10
    ELSE
        MOVE 0 TO OT-AMOUNT
    END-IF
    END-IF
    END-IF.
